# Edge (Miniflare) test bundle artifact
test/edge/_worker.mjs

# Bun writes this on `bun install`, and nothing here consumes it: `npm run test:bun` runs
# `bun test` against the node_modules npm installed, which package-lock.json already pins.
# deno.lock IS tracked, and that asymmetry is deliberate — the Deno tests import `npm:` and
# `jsr:` specifiers that Deno resolves against registries, so only a lockfile makes them
# reproducible. Bun resolves the same package.json npm does.
bun.lock
